    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52558" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰλαύρεια</span></b> , ἡ,
			<u>Calauria</u>, an island off Troezen, <i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			3.1243
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			4.752.18
		</span></i> (Troezen, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), etc.; later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλαυρία</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			8.6.3
		</span></i>, etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰλαύρῐα</span></b> ,
			ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			D.P.
			499
		</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰλαυρεάτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλά̆μ-τᾱς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>citizen of C.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.839
			</span></i> (Calauria, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλαυρῖτις</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθάργυρος</span>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαλαυθρῖτις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.87
			</span></i>.</div>
